- id: src:gengchen:ch21:future-title-baochai-fengjie
  type: EARLY_COMMENT
  tier: W1_DIRECT
  title: 庚辰本第二十一回回前总评——后回宝钗凤姐完整题目
  witness:
    siglum: GENGCHEN
    label: 庚辰本
    annotation: 第二十一回回前总评；上下文以“庚有客题”起
  container:
    ref: asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf
    sha256: 37441da3cb438d1b3eab2b511aa6f1695f309192fa63bea842413ff91655c1d7
  locator:
    schema_version: 2
    kind: PDF_TEXT_SPANS
    extraction_ref: asset:sha256:e3fae3441a9593750b51ead034891d2295360a046816b6d2b59cd46c07d331f7
    output_sha256: 628f2e057a93f48dfdf326e8ba1bfecea1fd2b30f418314046842b8bf46c8920
    spans:
    - unit_ref: pdf:page:300
      start: 250
      end: 273
    - unit_ref: pdf:page:300
      start: 274
      end: 290
    joiner: ''
    raw_text_sha256: 326d95c16cfcc89051cea051f84fcefe93b838c0dc80fab310c12ec7dace0a99
  text: 此曰“娇嗔箴宝玉”“软语救贾琏”，后曰“薛宝钗借词含讽谏，王熙凤知命强英雄”。
  text_sha256: 326d95c16cfcc89051cea051f84fcefe93b838c0dc80fab310c12ec7dace0a99
  notes: 该证据支持完整未来回目文字；不支持本工程“第90回”的具体编号。
  locator_verification:
    status: VERIFIED
    reason: Exact excerpt recomputed from fixed carrier; omitted PDF line breaks recorded
      in migration audit.
    report_ref: asset:sha256:358745b8a7e9232434f7bc8b740a9109d176eebbd491982c748f3d34a118cf46
    report_sha256: 358745b8a7e9232434f7bc8b740a9109d176eebbd491982c748f3d34a118cf46
