    parsed_lines: 8603-8619
- id: src:gengchen:ch20:xiren-prison-drafts
  type: EARLY_COMMENT
  tier: W1_SEEN
  title: 庚辰本第二十回眉批——袭人标目与狱神庙稿
  witness:
    siglum: GENGCHEN
    label: 庚辰本
    annotation: 庚眉；丁亥夏，畸笏叟；自述曾见誊清稿
  container:
    ref: asset:primary:hlm:zhihui:v3.1416:pdf
    sha256: 37441da3cb438d1b3eab2b511aa6f1695f309192fa63bea842413ff91655c1d7
  locator:
    schema_version: 2
    kind: PDF_TEXT_SPANS
    extraction_ref: asset:sha256:e3fae3441a9593750b51ead034891d2295360a046816b6d2b59cd46c07d331f7
    output_sha256: 628f2e057a93f48dfdf326e8ba1bfecea1fd2b30f418314046842b8bf46c8920
    spans:
    - unit_ref: pdf:page:290
      start: 643
      end: 654
    - unit_ref: pdf:page:290
      start: 655
      end: 690
    - unit_ref: pdf:page:290
      start: 691
      end: 717
    joiner: ''
    raw_text_sha256: 32c3ec319cacd38a250240614677ef38604d603a0fd2d9f6c205aa97d226fa74
  text: 茜雪至“狱神庙”方呈正文。袭人正文标目曰“花袭人有始有终”，余只见有一次誊清时，与“狱神庙慰宝玉”等五六稿，被借阅者迷失，叹叹！丁亥夏。畸笏叟。
  text_sha256: 32c3ec319cacd38a250240614677ef38604d603a0fd2d9f6c205aa97d226fa74
  notes: “花袭人有始有终”明称正文标目；“狱神庙慰宝玉”处在见过的稿件/稿名语境。
  locator_verification:
    status: VERIFIED
    reason: Exact excerpt recomputed from fixed carrier; omitted PDF line breaks recorded
      in migration audit.
    report_ref: asset:sha256:2c0efdf91f3bb930d07ca00df52c2b473e7c7343791e6d5bb2f81566f26fe5b0
    report_sha256: 2c0efdf91f3bb930d07ca00df52c2b473e7c7343791e6d5bb2f81566f26fe5b0
    source_record_sha256: 0f879d54fe0538fd4774ea4e10c46cfdedc6ee5800f7676d9131edb0845ae484
  legacy_locator:
    chapter: 20
    parsed_lines: 8311-8324
