    joiner: ''
    raw_text_sha256: b3f86a33132d43d705e4c6b70dfee95d0817d00efcaf3adabdde4a2049698fd7
  text: “塞玉”一段，又为“误窃”一回伏线。晴雯茜雪二婢，又为后文先作一引。
  text_sha256: b3f86a33132d43d705e4c6b70dfee95d0817d00efcaf3adabdde4a2049698fd7
  notes: 支持后文“误窃”回称/接口；不能单独证明正式原回目或具体回次。
  locator_verification:
    status: VERIFIED
    reason: Exact excerpt recomputed from fixed carrier; omitted PDF line breaks recorded
      in migration audit.
